          </div>

          <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-3 font-mono text-xs text-[#EDE8DF]/75">
            <span class="text-[#5A6B54] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3 font-semibold">ATELIER DIRECTORY</span>
            <div>ðŸ“ 28 Bach Dang, Thach Thang, Hai Chau, Da Nang, Vietnam</div>
            <div>â° 07:30 â€” 18:00 Daily</div>
            <div>ðŸ“ž (+84) 905 123 456</div>
            <div>âœ‰ï¸ roastery@hatmoc-coffee.com</div>
          </div>
